+# MainThrive patch 0016: the shared store on PostgreSQL instead of Redis, for
+# several instances behind one load balancer. Everything a replica would keep
+# for itself (settings, pairing and hand-off codes, devices, limits) goes to
+# the database the standard PG* variables name; TLS is verified, against
